      "message": "\u003e Critical: Event Re-triggering on Combined Masks\n\nThe comment is incorrect. It there is more than only console event, the event set would be printed anyway\n\n\u003e Unread Logs During Sleep\n\nIt\u0027s intended. There are always some logs after resuming device or exiting S0. No need to add additional logic.\n\n\u003e Unmocked USB Suspend State in Tests\n\n`CONFIG_EC_HOST_CMD_BACKEND_USB` is not enabled in tests.\n\n\u003e Header Inclusion\n\nNot needed, the header is always present.\n\n\u003e Unnecessary Parentheses\n\nI know it\u0027s unnecessary, but for me it improves readability.\n\n\u003e Variable Initialization\n\nI think keeping `new_console_log` and `console_log_notify_host` in one #ifdef is better.\n\n\nSo IMO no changes needed.",
